"return": "List<JobDefinition>", "signature": "List<JobDefinition> addDepenciesAndSort(List<JobDefinition> jobs)", "full_signature": "protected List<JobDefinition> addDepenciesAndSort(List<JobDefinition> jobs)", "class_method_signature": "SeedingSchedule.addDepenciesAndSort(List<JobDefinition> jobs)", "testcase": false, "constructor": false}, {"identifier": "getSortedToSatisfyDependencies", "parameters": "(List<JobDefinition> jobs)", "modifiers": "protected static", "return": "List<JobDefinition>", "signature": "List<JobDefinition> getSortedToSatisfyDependencies(List<JobDefinition> jobs)", "full_signature": "protected static List<JobDefinition> getSortedToSatisfyDependencies(List<JobDefinition> jobs)", "class_method_signature": "SeedingSchedule.getSortedToSatisfyDependencies(List<JobDefinition> jobs)", "testcase": false, "constructor": false}, {"identifier": "addDependenciesForSeeding", "parameters": "(List<JobDefinition> jobs)", "modifiers": "protected", "return": "List<JobDefinition>", "signature": "List<JobDefinition> addDependenciesForSeeding(List<JobDefinition> jobs)", "full_signature": "protected List<JobDefinition> addDependenciesForSeeding(List<JobDefinition> jobs)", "class_method_signature": "SeedingSchedule.addDependenciesForSeeding(List<JobDefinition> jobs)", "testcase": false, "constructor": false}, {"identifier": "calculateInputClasses", "parameters": "(JobDefinition job)", "modifiers": "private", "return": "Set<String>", "signature": "Set<String> calculateInputClasses(JobDefinition job)", "full_signature": "private Set<String> calculateInputClasses(JobDefinition job)", "class_method_signature": "SeedingSchedule.calculateInputClasses(JobDefinition job)", "testcase": false, "constructor": false}, {"identifier": "calculateAncestors", "parameters": "(JobDefinition job)", "modifiers": "private", "return": "Set<String>", "signature": "Set<String> calculateAncestors(JobDefinition job)", "full_signature": "private Set<String> calculateAncestors(JobDefinition job)", "class_method_signature": "SeedingSchedule.calculateAncestors(JobDefinition job)", "testcase": false, "constructor": false}], "file": "master/src/main/java/org/evosuite/continuous/job/schedule/SeedingSchedule.java"}, "focal_method": {"identifier": "getSortedToSatisfyDependencies", "parameters": "(List<JobDefinition> jobs)", "modifiers": "protected static", "return": "List<JobDefinition>", "body": "protected static List<JobDefinition> getSortedToSatisfyDependencies(List<JobDefinition> jobs){\n\n\t\tQueue<JobDefinition> toAssign = new LinkedList<>(jobs);\n\t\tList<JobDefinition> postponed = new LinkedList<>();\n\n\t\tList<JobDefinition> out = new ArrayList<>(jobs.size());\n\t\tSet<String> assigned = new HashSet<>();\n\n\t\t/*\n\t\t * Note: the code here is similar to what done in JobExecutor\n\t\t */\n\t\t\n\t\tmainLoop: while(!toAssign.isEmpty() || !postponed.isEmpty()){\n\n\t\t\tJobDefinition chosenJob = null;\n\n\t\t\t//postponed jobs have the priority\n\t\t\tif(!postponed.isEmpty()){\n\t\t\t\tIterator<JobDefinition> iterator = postponed.iterator();\n\t\t\t\tpostponedLoop : while(iterator.hasNext()){\n\t\t\t\t\tJobDefinition job = iterator.next();\n\t\t\t\t\tif(job.areDependenciesSatisfied(jobs,assigned)){\n\t\t\t\t\t\tchosenJob = job;\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\titerator.remove();\n\t\t\t\t\t\tbreak postponedLoop;\n\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\tif(chosenJob == null && toAssign.isEmpty()){\n\t\t\t\t/*\n\t\t\t\t * nothing satisfied in 'postponed', and nothing left in 'toAssign'.\n\t\t\t\t * so just pick up one (the oldest)\n\t\t\t\t */\n\t\t\t\tassert !postponed.isEmpty();\n\t\t\t\tchosenJob = postponed.remove(0);\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\tif(chosenJob == null){\n\t\t\t\tassert !toAssign.isEmpty();\n\n\t\t\t\ttoExecuteLoop : while(!toAssign.isEmpty()){\n\t\t\t\t\tJobDefinition job = toAssign.poll();\n\t\t\t\t\tif(job.areDependenciesSatisfied(jobs,assigned)){\n\t\t\t\t\t\tchosenJob = job;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tbreak toExecuteLoop;\n\t\t\t\t\t}  else {\n\t\t\t\t\t\tpostponed.add(job);\n\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\t\tif(chosenJob == null){\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tassert !postponed.isEmpty() && toAssign.isEmpty();\n\t\t\t\t\tcontinue mainLoop;\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tout.add(chosenJob);\n\t\t\tassigned.add(chosenJob.cut);\n\t\t}\n\t\t\n\t\treturn out;\n\t}", "signature": "List<JobDefinition> getSortedToSatisfyDependencies(List<JobDefinition> jobs)", "full_signature": "protected static List<JobDefinition> getSortedToSatisfyDependencies(List<JobDefinition> jobs)", "class_method_signature": "SeedingSchedule.getSortedToSatisfyDependencies(List<JobDefinition> jobs)", "testcase": false, "constructor": false, "invocations": ["size", "isEmpty", "isEmpty", "isEmpty", "iterator", "hasNext", "next", "areDependenciesSatisfied", "remove", "isEmpty", "isEmpty", "remove", "isEmpty", "isEmpty", "poll", "areDependenciesSatisfied", "add", "isEmpty", "isEmpty", "add", "add"]}, "repository": {"repo_id": 42201162, "url": "https://github.com/EvoSuite/evosuite", "language": "Java", "is_fork": false, "fork_count": 183, "stargazer_count": 378, "size": 233555, "license": "licensed"}}